meta {
  name: Get Phone Numbers
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: https://webexapis.com/v1/telephony/config/numbers
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~available: true
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: false
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  Use this request to get phone numbers in the org — the "Get Phone Numbers" endpoint. You can
  toggle the available parameter to only show numbers that are not currently assigned.

  **Parameters**
  - `available` (query, disabled by default) — when enabled and set to `true`, filters the results
    to only unassigned numbers, which is useful when you're about to assign one to a new person
    (see "Provision User").

  Reference: https://developer.webex.com/calling/docs/api/v1/numbers/get-phone-numbers-for-an-organization-with-given-criteria

  ---
  *Documentation written by AI (Claude) as a companion to the WebexOne 2026 API Overview session.*
}
